cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool in engineering work or research, cite it as below."
title: "autosar-agent-skills: zero-dependency AUTOSAR / CAN engineering tools for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  Zero-dependency (Python standard library) tooling for AUTOSAR Classic Platform
  and CAN communication matrix engineering. dbc-matrix-audit performs 11
  structural checks on DBC files (bit-field overlap, out-of-range signals,
  left/right asymmetry, naming drift, GBK encoding) plus two-revision diff, live
  frame decoding and CSV export. arxml-dbc-consistency cross-validates ARXML
  ECUC configuration against a DBC matrix across 26 check codes covering CAN ID
  binding, DLC, bit geometry, byte order, init values, PduR routing and TX/RX
  direction. Scope is deliberately static analysis only: no bus simulation and
  no runtime behaviour is verified.
